        "original_id": "5d86d115-87eb-5e45-a64d-c6320217ba92",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles R. Black Jr., Paul Manafort, Donald Trump Jr., Jared Kushner, Natalia Veselnitskaya, Peter G. Kelly, John F. Scruggs, James Healey\n- Companies: Prime Policy Group, Burson-Marsteller Global Public Relations, BKSH & Associates Worldwide, Timmons & Company\n- Places: Washington, D.C., Trump Tower, New York City\n- Events: Trump campaign–Russian meeting\n\nFacts:\n- Charles R. Black Jr., born in 1947, is the chairman of Prime Policy Group.\n- Paul Manafort, born on April 1, 1949, is an American lawyer, lobbyist, and political consultant.\n- BKSH & Associates Worldwide was a Washington, D.C.-based lobbying firm whose principals included Charles R. Black Jr., Peter G. Kelly, John F. Scruggs, and James Healey.\n- In 2010, BKSH & Associates Worldwide merged with Timmons & Company to form Prime Policy Group.\n- Prime Policy Group is a public affairs firm and a subsidiary of Burson-Marsteller Global Public Relations.\n- On June 9, 2016, a meeting at Trump Tower in New York City involved Donald Trump Jr., Jared Kushner, Paul Manafort, and at least five others, including Russian lawyer Natalia Veselnitskaya.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
